  "prompt": "Một quả đạn pháo được bắn ra khỏi nòng pháo với vận tốc ban đầu <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi>/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></semantics></math> hợp với phương ngang một góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math>. Trong Vật lí, ta biết rằng, nếu bỏ qua sức cản của không khí và coi quả đạn pháo được bắn ra từ mặt đất thì quỹ đạo của quả đạn tuân theo phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, ở đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mi>/</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math> là gia tốc trọng trường.\n\t<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Tính theo góc bắn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math> tầm xa mà quả đạn đạt tới (tức là khoảng cách từ vị trí bắn đến điểm quả đạn chạm đất).</li><li>Tìm góc bắn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math> để quả đạn trúng mục tiêu cách vị trí đặt khẩu pháo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tìm góc bắn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math> để quả đạn bay xa nhất.</li></ol>",
  "choices": [],
  "correct": null,
  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Quả đạn chạm đất <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Khi đó:<div class=\"tex-center\"><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tVậy tầm xa của quả đạn tính theo góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>α</mi></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Để quả đạn trúng mục tiêu cách vị trí đặt khẩu pháo <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>22000</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.222em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thì\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>22000</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>.</mi><msup><mn>500</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>.</mi><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>22000</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4312</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>tan</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4312</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4312</mn><msup><mo>tan</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>−</mo><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4312</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>57</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>75</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>⇔</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mn>180</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div> Do góc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> nên ta chọn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>30</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> hoặc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tầm  xa của quả đạn  là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mi>g</mi></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, do đó quả đạn bay xa nhất khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></semantics></math> lớn nhất. Ta có: <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mo>cos</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mi>.</mi><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>tan</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>tan</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow></semantics></math>  nên ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mo>tan</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>α</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Dấu bằng xảy ra khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>tan</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> (do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mn>90</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>). <br>Vậy khi góc bắn <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>45</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math> thì quả đạn bay xa nhất.<div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div></li></ol>",
